d real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{|2 x|\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed integral is\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "a389fa12-c56e-5666-b913-2d1803b92aee" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "a389fa12-c56e-5666-b913-2d1803b92aee" :question/answer-fields "9a0278f0-7eaf-5656-81fa-58702d8db23d"] [:db/ensure "a389fa12-c56e-5666-b913-2d1803b92aee" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "a389fa12-c56e-5666-b913-2d1803b92aee"] [:db/add "d337e478-9e3d-5fee-a8e2-b96923986bc6" :answer/id #uuid "d337e478-9e3d-5fee-a8e2-b96923986bc6"] [:db/add "d337e478-9e3d-5fee-a8e2-b96923986bc6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d337e478-9e3d-5fee-a8e2-b96923986bc6" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)"] [:db/ensure "d337e478-9e3d-5fee-a8e2-b96923986bc6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5f54c10e-b1d1-502a-887b-5f22b474dd2c" :answer/id #uuid "5f54c10e-b1d1-502a-887b-5f22b474dd2c"] [:db/add "5f54c10e-b1d1-502a-887b-5f22b474dd2c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5f54c10e-b1d1-502a-887b-5f22b474dd2c" :answer/value "- \\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)"] [:db/ensure "5f54c10e-b1d1-502a-887b-5f22b474dd2c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4c82403a-eca7-54a8-9c6f-185d871da9c4" :answer/id #uuid "4c82403a-eca7-54a8-9c6f-185d871da9c4"] [:db/add "4c82403a-eca7-54a8-9c6f-185d871da9c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4c82403a-eca7-54a8-9c6f-185d871da9c4" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sq