arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "bacbded8-6884-5d02-af40-16c8adf1cd96" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=\\frac{4}{5}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{|5 x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "bacbded8-6884-5d02-af40-16c8adf1cd96" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "bacbded8-6884-5d02-af40-16c8adf1cd96" :question/answer-fields "cbb9e342-9d9a-5b33-a07b-d9352e99a26a"] [:db/ensure "bacbded8-6884-5d02-af40-16c8adf1cd96" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "bacbded8-6884-5d02-af40-16c8adf1cd96"] [:db/add "40feda46-d342-5cef-ba12-30773f0d3723" :answer/id #uuid "40feda46-d342-5cef-ba12-30773f0d3723"] [:db/add "40feda46-d342-5cef-ba12-30773f0d3723" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "40feda46-d342-5cef-ba12-30773f0d3723" :answer/value "\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "40feda46-d342-5cef-ba12-30773f0d3723" :answer/validate] [:db/add "56ef5604-2eb6-5198-9605-7786a819ee07" :answer/id #uuid "56ef5604-2eb6-5198-9605-7786a819ee07"] [:db/add "56ef5604-2eb6-5198-9605-7786a819ee07" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "56ef5604-2eb6-5198-9605-7786a819ee07" 