}=\\frac{3}{5}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{|5 x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "5a4cf722-3932-5fb6-8d70-364a496ddcfb" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "5a4cf722-3932-5fb6-8d70-364a496ddcfb" :question/answer-fields "7f0fef05-ab2a-5429-9f3b-e358d19bd9af"] [:db/ensure "5a4cf722-3932-5fb6-8d70-364a496ddcfb" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "5a4cf722-3932-5fb6-8d70-364a496ddcfb"] [:db/add "5a75205a-6fec-50af-b81c-a92046480f5b" :answer/id #uuid "5a75205a-6fec-50af-b81c-a92046480f5b"] [:db/add "5a75205a-6fec-50af-b81c-a92046480f5b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5a75205a-6fec-50af-b81c-a92046480f5b" :answer/value "-2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "5a75205a-6fec-50af-b81c-a92046480f5b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a1ce50cb-a9c5-5784-b722-53d59b2eb6db" :answer/id #uuid "a1ce50cb-a9c5-5784-b722-53d59b2eb6db"] [:db/add "a1ce50cb-a9c5-5784-b722-53d59b2eb6db" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a1ce50cb-a9c5-5784-b722-53d59b2eb6db" :answer/value "-2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "a1ce50cb-a9c5-5784-b722-53d59b2eb6db" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7f9506e5-3edd-5b28-a3d9-7a8ef5d2747d" :answer/id #uuid "7f9506e5-3edd-5b28-a3d9-7a8ef5d2747d"] [:db/add "7f9506e5-3edd-5b28-a3d9-7a8ef5d2747d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7f9506e5-3edd-5b28-a3d9-7a8ef5d2747d" :answer/value "2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left