\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $10\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=2$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "049adf91-8527-55f1-a6ee-6f90fabbcdd7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "049adf91-8527-55f1-a6ee-6f90fabbcdd7" :question/answer-fields "bfd70697-b91d-5c47-a181-3da1acce89c9"] [:db/ensure "049adf91-8527-55f1-a6ee-6f90fabbcdd7" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "049adf91-8527-55f1-a6ee-6f90fabbcdd7"] [:db/add "513725b9-174c-57d6-b726-87c5f271d0ad" :answer/id #uuid "513725b9-174c-57d6-b726-87c5f271d0ad"] [:db/add "513725b9-174c-57d6-b726-87c5f271d0ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "513725b9-174c-57d6-b726-87c5f271d0ad" :answer/value "4\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(8 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "513725b9-174c-57d6-b726-87c5f271d0ad" :answer/validate] [:db/add "84bd64a7-02b2-590b-94bf-390d16a28f56" :answer/id #uuid "84bd64a7-02b2-590b-94bf-390d16a28f56"] [:db/add "84bd64a7-02b2-590b-94bf-390d16a28f56" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "84bd64a7-02b2-590b-94bf-390d16a28f56" :answer/value "4\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "84bd64a7-02b2-590b-94bf-390d16a28f56" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e734e59e-f86e-5bf3-89e2-d816b06704ab" :answer/id #uuid "e734e59e-f86e-5bf3-89e2-d816b06704ab"] [:db/add "e734e59e-f86e-5bf3-89e2-d816b06704ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e734e59e-f86e-5bf3-89e2-d816b06704ab" :answer/value "4\\left(\\ope