r is $3\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}=1$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "e331ac2e-b4b6-57b2-8b0f-429a3474445c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "e331ac2e-b4b6-57b2-8b0f-429a3474445c" :question/answer-fields "ffdbc59b-4a98-5be2-9c09-af4838aeaa1b"] [:db/ensure "e331ac2e-b4b6-57b2-8b0f-429a3474445c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "e331ac2e-b4b6-57b2-8b0f-429a3474445c"] [:db/add "2658604b-a626-5178-a760-4f6e99b1f804" :answer/id #uuid "2658604b-a626-5178-a760-4f6e99b1f804"] [:db/add "2658604b-a626-5178-a760-4f6e99b1f804" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2658604b-a626-5178-a760-4f6e99b1f804" :answer/value "3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "2658604b-a626-5178-a760-4f6e99b1f804" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fa2e53a6-5258-5f95-88f1-f13797ab2172" :answer/id #uuid "fa2e53a6-5258-5f95-88f1-f13797ab2172"] [:db/add "fa2e53a6-5258-5f95-88f1-f13797ab2172" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fa2e53a6-5258-5f95-88f1-f13797ab2172" :answer/value "6\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "fa2e53a6-5258-5f95-88f1-f13797ab2172" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cb30fedb-fba5-5743-bc4f-0e48589d012b" :answer/id #uuid "cb30fedb-fba5-5743-bc4f-0e48589d012b"] [:db/add "cb30fedb-fba5-5743-bc4f-0e48589d012b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cb30fedb-fba5-5743-bc4f-0e48589d012b" :answer/value "3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(\\frac{5 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "cb30fedb-fba5-5743-bc4f-0e48589d012b" :answer/vali