{|x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "491e4c26-a08b-53a0-9c8a-2f14d053b450" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\n\nBecause $5>0$, $|u|=5|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/5$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $15\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}=3$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{|x|\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\left|{u}\\right|}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(5 x \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "491e4c26-a08b-53a0-9c8a-2f14d053b450" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "491e4c26-a08b-53a0-9c8a-2f14d053b450" :question/answer-fields "e8b4aec0-a68b-5d4a-81cd-84562d3316c9"] [:db/ensure "491e4c26-a08b-53a0-9c8a-2f14d053b450" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions "491e4c26-a08b-53a0-9c8a-2f14d053b450"] [:db/add "0d5b56c9-7607-5db4-bdf6-e7e62ef6573d" :answer/id #uuid "0d5b56c9-7607-5db4-bdf6-e7e62ef6573d"] [:db/add "0d5b56c9-7607-5db4-bdf6-e7e62ef6573d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0d5b56c9-7607-5db4-bdf6-e7e62ef6573d" :answer/value "-4\\left(\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "0d5b56c9-7607-5db4-bdf6-e7e62ef6573d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "84490db6-6b93-5265-8ae3-8875e2514a2e" :answer/id #uuid "84490db6-6b93-5265-